<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?>
<catalogue xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema" id="cat-30a0-30b0-30c0-0001" name="Legiones Astartes" revision="7" battleScribeVersion="2.03" library="false" gameSystemId="sys-a1d2-5ede-e74f-7479" gameSystemRevision="4" type="catalogue">
  <comment>Revision 7: Legion Tactical Squad rebuilt around the current 10-20 model entry, restricted Sergeant Armoury and weapon slots that scale per ten models.</comment>
  <readme>The Tactical Sergeant is a single Sergeant with a 50 point restricted Armoury allowance. Master-crafted weapons, Special Issue Ammunition, Boarding Shields, Iron Halos and other officer/specialist-only equipment are intentionally excluded. Each ten-model block provides one Special and one Heavy Weapon slot; an unused Heavy slot unlocks one additional Special slot.</readme>

  <sharedSelectionEntries>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Bolter" hidden="false" id="gear-bolter">
      <profiles><profile name="Bolter" typeId="prof-ranged" typeName="Ranged Weapon" hidden="false" id="prof-bolter"><characteristics><characteristic name="Range" typeId="ranged-range">24&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="S" typeId="ranged-s">4</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="ranged-ap">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Type" typeId="ranged-type">Rapid Fire</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
